# Claude Code — local working context, deliberately not published.
#
# These stay on disk and keep working locally; git simply never sees them.
# CLAUDE.md pulls in the two spec docs via @-imports, so they travel together
# or not at all. A fresh clone therefore has NO project context or spec —
# copy this set across by hand when moving machines.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
SPEC.md
spotential-feature-spec.md
spotential-tech-stack.md

